{"_id":"68a7363c8ec3d8323af1f23e","nodeId":"nwFaz9i-1s0WVrVaFsoqb","roadmapSlug":"sql","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:40.099Z","description":"# Pivot / Unpivot Operations\n\nPivot and unpivot operations transform the structure of data within a table. Pivoting rotates rows into columns, aggregating data based on common values. Conversely, unpivoting transforms columns into rows, often expanding a table's length while reducing its width. These operations are useful for reshaping data for reporting or analysis.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"SQL PIVOT","url":"https://builtin.com/articles/sql-pivot","_id":"69bba6b933a0ad7a57afe6dc"},{"type":"article","title":"SQL UNPIVOT","url":"https://duckdb.org/docs/sql/statements/unpivot.html","_id":"69bba6b933a0ad7a57afe6dd"}],"updatedAt":"2026-03-19T07:33:13.507Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d0416838","title":"DataCamp - SQL Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/ZVeXng"},{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d04167c7","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/sql/content/nwFaz9i-1s0WVrVaFsoqb.md"}